#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:84
#: 3ca15a9c2bf746d1bb3863987beabfc3
msgid "CLI pointers"
msgstr "CLI 要点"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:86
#: 98720675017d4e758799d0998aba8274
msgid ""
"Run from a workspace that contains `robots/` (the README uses "
"`examples/IsaacSim` in the lerobot_ros2 tree). Flags below are from the "
"composer README; see that file for the full set."
msgstr ""
"在含 `robots/` 的工作区目录下运行（README 使用 lerobot_ros2 树中的 "
"`examples/IsaacSim`）。下列参数来自 composer README；完整集合以该文件为准。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:88
#: f9d18d0ddb824ee495c4c9eb13b7adb7
msgid ""
"# Task queue\n"
"motion-generation\n"
"motion-generation --robot fiveages_w2 --task-key navigate_and_dex_grasp "
"--scene apple\n"
"motion-generation --lang zh\n"
"\n"
"# ROS 2 stack (see docs/ROS2_STACK.md)\n"
"ros2-stack launch --robot fiveages_w2 --group dex_hand\n"
"ros2-stack status --robot fiveages_w2\n"
"ros2-stack logs --robot fiveages_w2 -f\n"
"ros2-stack stop --robot fiveages_w2\n"
"\n"
"# Grasp generation UI (does not replace the two CLIs above)\n"
"grasp-generation serve --robot fiveages_w2 --workspace .\n"
"\n"
"# Isaac Sim entity pose (needs /get_entity_state)\n"
"check-isaac-pose /World/FiveAges_W2/base_link\n"
"\n"
"# Current joints / EE pose (pasteable into YAML)\n"
"check-robot-status --robot fiveages_w2 --workspace .\n"
msgstr ""
"# Task queue\n"
"motion-generation\n"
"motion-generation --robot fiveages_w2 --task-key navigate_and_dex_grasp "
"--scene apple\n"
"motion-generation --lang zh\n"
"\n"
"# ROS 2 stack (see docs/ROS2_STACK.md)\n"
"ros2-stack launch --robot fiveages_w2 --group dex_hand\n"
"ros2-stack status --robot fiveages_w2\n"
"ros2-stack logs --robot fiveages_w2 -f\n"
"ros2-stack stop --robot fiveages_w2\n"
"\n"
"# Grasp generation UI (does not replace the two CLIs above)\n"
"grasp-generation serve --robot fiveages_w2 --workspace .\n"
"\n"
"# Isaac Sim entity pose (needs /get_entity_state)\n"
"check-isaac-pose /World/FiveAges_W2/base_link\n"
"\n"
"# Current joints / EE pose (pasteable into YAML)\n"
"check-robot-status --robot fiveages_w2 --workspace .\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:110
#: a802cec5db0840f980474e2fd2d2cc0a
msgid ""
"`motion-generation` default `workspace_dir` is the current working "
"directory. Language: `--lang` > `MOTION_GENERATION_LANG` > "
"`.motion_last.json` > system `LANG`. Preferences such as "
"`ensure_ros2_stack` are stored in workspace-root `.motion_last.json` "
"(gitignored)."
msgstr ""
"`motion-generation` 默认 `workspace_dir` 为当前工作目录。语言优先级：`--lang` > "
"`MOTION_GENERATION_LANG` > `.motion_last.json` > 系统 "
"`LANG`。`ensure_ros2_stack` 等偏好缓存在工作区根目录的 `.motion_last.json`（已 "
"gitignore）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:112
#: 7e095926fc4d4bd49b2a60b49bcdbc84
msgid "End-effector frames"
msgstr "末端坐标系"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:114
#: a973ad30ea9348cdb3c94a1d14953474
msgid ""
"[`stages_in_command_ee_frame`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/main/robot_action_composer/task_runtime/placement/frames.py)"
" rewrites a stage pose into the link OCS2 tracks. The two paths are not "
"the same source:"
msgstr ""
"[`stages_in_command_ee_frame`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_action_composer/blob/main/robot_action_composer/task_runtime/placement/frames.py)"
" 把阶段位姿改写成 OCS2 跟踪的连杆。两条路径不是同一个来源："

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:116
#: 32361dd521d540d4885f860475fac91a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**No `ee_tip` in `robot.yaml`.** Live TF from `ee_target_frame` to "
"`ee_command_frame`. Public G1D ([`robot.yaml`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/robots/Unitree/G1D/robot.yaml))"
" sets `{arm}_eef` → `{arm}_tcp`."
msgstr ""
"**`robot.yaml` 没有 `ee_tip`。** 用实时 TF，从 `ee_target_frame` 到 "
"`ee_command_frame`。公开的 G1D（[`robot.yaml`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/robots/Unitree/G1D/robot.yaml)）是"
" `{arm}_eef` → `{arm}_tcp`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/5-robot_action_composer.md:117
#: 897b39210b5d41e88b87976fa2574e38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`ee_tip` set.** First the USD local chain tip → parent (`parent_prim` /"
" `tip_prim`), then an optional live TF from that parent frame to "
"`ee_command_frame`. On W2, OCS2 often tracks `{arm}_eef`, not "
"`{arm}_tcp`. A project `robot.yaml` on [fa-project-"
"usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) `feature/sinopec-"
"test-tube-picking` uses this path (needs access). The prim paths stay in "
"that file."
msgstr ""
"**设置了 `ee_tip`。** 先走 USD 局部链，尖端到父级（`parent_prim` / `tip_prim`），再可选地用实时 TF"
" 从该父级帧到 `ee_command_frame`。W2 上 OCS2 常常跟踪 `{arm}_eef`，而不是 `{arm}_tcp"
"`。[fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) 分支 "
"`feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking` 上的项目 `robot.yaml` "
"走这条路径（需要权限）。图元路径留在那个文件里。"

